<p>Conceptualization, D.B., A.B., K.S., B.A., U.Y., D.S., A.G., S.K., K.T., G.Z. and M.B.; Methodology, D.B., A.B., A.G. and K.S.; Software, B.A. and D.S.; Validation, D.B., B.A., K.T., A.B. and U.Y.; Formal analysis, D.S. and M.B.; Investigation, D.B., K.T., D.S. and U.Y.; Resources, D.B. and B.A.; Data curation, A.G. and M.B.; Writing—original draft preparation, D.B., B.A., D.S. and K.S.; Writing—review and editing, B.A., A.B., A.G. and S.K.; Visualization, D.B., D.S. and G.Z.; Supervision, A.B., D.B. and K.S.; Project administration, A.B.; Funding acquisition, M.B. and A.G. All authors have read and agreed to the published version of the manuscript.</p></section><section id="notes2"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Institutional Review Board Statement</h2>
<p>The study was conducted in accordance with the Declaration of Helsinki, and approved by the Local Ethics Committees of the Research Institute of Balneology and Medical Rehabilitation (Approval code: 01-04 №412, Approval date: 22 October 2024) and Al-Farabi Kazakh National University (IRB Approval code: IRB-Al709, Approval date: 18 September 2025).</p></section><section id="notes3"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Informed Consent Statement</h2>
